Actually, I just realized something important. Let me look at the `_gnutls_x509_read_string` function one more time:

```c
result = asn1_read_value_type(c, root, NULL, &len, &rtype);
if (result != ASN1_MEM_ERROR) {
    gnutls_assert();
    result = _gnutls_asn2err(result);
