The function reads a value from an ASN1 tree and decodes it. The `etype` parameter specifies the expected type of the string. But `rtype` is the actual type of the field in the ASN1 tree.

For `authSafe.content`, the field is an OCTET STRING. So `rtype = ASN1_ETYPE_OCTET_STRING`. `asn1_read_value` returns the content of the OCTET STRING (without the tag and length).

